<title>USA: Great Western reaches $17.2 mln settlement.</title>
<headline>Great Western reaches $17.2 mln settlement.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Western Financial Corp said it reached a $17.2 million settlement with plaintiffs to settle state and federal class action lawsuits alleging improper sales practices by Great Western's brokerage unit.</p>
<p>A hearing was held in federal court Monday and a preliminary approval of the settlement granted. A further hearing for final approval was set for April 14.</p>
